{"_note":"「我的 App」标记写回(/manage 页每行的 ★ 开关调用):data.set mine_<appId> = 0/1。详情页 app.df 每次都 live 读这个键(不进 pack),标完即生效。删除关注时 manage 也调它清 0 —— 不留孤儿标记。","version":1,"actions":[{"op":"set","props":{"key":"aid","value":"${appId}","_note":"入参先落地(§9.5 #3)。"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"mv","value":"$[parseNumber::(${v},0)]"}},{"op":"if","props":{"val":"$[if::(gt::(length::(${aid}),0),1,0)]","_note":"appId 为空什么都不写 —— 写出一个 mine_ 裸键谁也读不到,纯垃圾。"},"items":[{"action":"data.set","params":{"key":"mine_${aid}","value":"${mv}"}}]},{"_note":"竞品对比组件读 mine_<id>:标完立刻让本包组件真取数重渲(G37)。放在 data.set 之后。","action":"widget.refresh"}]}
